  ultimatum storyline with magneto trying  to destroy the world starts off with  ultron shooting and killing the Scarlet  Witch hawkeye tries to kill magneto by  shooting an arrow at him but Quicksilver  takes the arrow and he dies as well now  in this ultimatum universe Quicksilver  and the Scarlet Witch are the children  of magneto now in this universe the  heroes all grouped together are called  The Ultimates and Magneto manages  to escape from The Ultimates but he also  manages to steal Thor's hammer first he  swears vengeance on the ultimate sand  using Thor's hammer and his magnetic  abilities he reverses Earth's polarity  this causes major lightning storms and a  tsunami to hit New York as well as  causing many other natural disasters  across the earth professor X using his  telepathic abilities discovers that  millions have died and he warns the  other heroes that magneto is the one to  blame they find that magneto is in a  floating Citadel and many of the heroes  including Professor X go after him to  stop him unfortunately this doesn't end  too well for many of the heroes that go  after magneto and many of them die  including the wasp angel dr. strange  Thor and Magneto himself even kills  Professor X and Wolverine ripping the  adamantium from his body and harming his  body in a way that his cells can't  regenerate so we really do see magneto  in the storyline had one of his most  powerful forms however it does go on to  reveal that dr. doom is actually the one  responsible for the scarlet witch's  death eventually magneto comes down from  his dissolution and he orders Cyclops to  blast his head off and which Cyclops  does it is then later revealed that  Quicksilver is actually alive and he  takes his father's helmet and he swears  vengeance on everyone so as you can see  it's a pretty brutal storyline that  involves many different heroes ranging  from the x-men to the Fantastic Four to  some of the Avengers as well and as I  mentioned there are five very 