g over from Fox  team up together the x-men the Fantastic  Four and our beloved Avengers will all  be finally in one movie teaming up the  third thing is that we're going to see  Magneto be introduced in a film in a way  that we have never seen him before in  this storyline the reason that he  decides to destroy the earth is because  of the death of his children The Scarlet  Witch and Quicksilver as I mentioned in  the ultimatum storyline magneto shifts  Earth's polarity and this is a worldwide  catastrophic event much like half of the  people from Earth were wiped away with  vanos a snap it seems like a lot of  people are going to die at the hands of  magneto and it's all going to be fueled  by his rage if Marvel decides to stick  true to the storyline and if that's true  that means that Quicksilver could be  returning there have been many reports  and there has actually been some scripts  leaks that say Quicksilver is returning  after all Aaron taylor-johnson the actor  who played Quicksilver in Avengers age  of Ultron does have more projects left  on his contract with Marvel Studios so  he could come back and the Wanda vision  show that's coming to Disney Plus but if  he does it looks like him and his sister  The Scarlet Witch may meet their fate  now it doesn't seem very likely that  Marvel Studios would kill off the  Scarlet Witch however that doesn't mean  that some catastrophic event couldn't  happen in the MCU to set magneto off but  whatever the reason it seems pretty  clear that the x-men's first true enemy  is going to be magneto the fourth major  thing that this could possibly reveal  if Marvel Studios decides to stick true  to the ultimate storyline is how the  x-men are going to come into the MCU at  the end of the ultimate story line  before magneto dies Nick Fury using the  telepathy powers of Jean Grey transmits  memories into Magneto's mind these  memories show him that the existence of  mutants was in fact the result of a  misguided genetic super-soldier  experiment an experiment that happened  decades ago of merging Nick Fury super  soldier blood and the DNA of Wolverine  and this could actually be the way that  Marvel Studios does decide to introduce  mutants into the Marvel Cinematic  Universe now it's widely speculated that  Black Widow could introduce Ursa Major  who is a mutant the actor the Dutch  giant is confirmed to be playing a role  in the Black Widow film and he hinted at  himself plain Ursa Major Black Widow is  also going to heavily deal with the  Super Soldier Serum and we even see  vials of this in the trailer for Black  Widow we know that all of the black  widows that are in the Red Room training  have been given the Super Soldier Serum  to enhance their abilities but we also  know that the serum is how they're being  controlled as well we also know that  Thunderbolt Ross is going to be  searching for the serum as well and it  is interesting that they would bring  back Super Soldier Serum in the  beginning of phase 4  however Marvel Studios President Kevin  Feige has said that the Black Widow film  is going to have a major impact on the  future of the MCU and it could be that  experiments done with the Super Soldier  Serum and humans could create mutants  and perhaps Ursa Major could be the  first mutant that we actually see in the  Marvel Cinematic Universe the fifth and  final thing that you need to know about  the ultimatum storyline is that it will  most likely lead up to Avengers secret  Wars battle world the event where the  Avengers the x-men the Fantastic Four as  well as many different villains  including Galactus and Doctor Doom all  come together in one huge movie just  like infinity war and endgame over the  next ten years or so Marvel is going to  continue to build up the new Marvel  Cinematic Universe with all of its new  characters and former characters as well  and it all has to lead up to something  there has to be some big finale  just like Avengers in game and the  events of this ultimatum stone  we'll set up god-emperor doom and in the  avengers secret wars battle world  storyline God Emperor Doom is God he  manages to steal the powers from the  Beyonder and he creates the battle world  god emperor doom combined with Galactus  are going to be the two next big bad  villains of the MCU which the Avengers  the Fantastic Four and the x-men will  most likely have to go against in  Avengers battle world so there's  actually a lot about the future of the  MCU that this ultimatum storyline  reveals but with the x-men and the  Fantastic Four head into the MCU very  soon now this is what we have to look  forward to and again it could reveal a  very good way that the mutants could be  introduced into the MCU but let me know  what you think about this how excited  are you for the x-men and the Fantastic  Four to finally enter the MCU and is  this a storyline that you can get  excited about be sure to drop your  comments and thoughts in the comments  down below and don't forget to like this  video and subscribe with notifications  turned on so you can stay up to date on  everything relating to the Marvel  Cinematic Universe we're also going to  be starting weekly giveaways next week  and for live updates you can follow me  on Twitter as always thank you all so  much for watching  woof woof

